+/*
+ * OmacVM, present-direct-surface prototype. With OMACVM_GL_PRESENT_DIRECT=1 and a
+ * scanout buffer that virgl made as an IOSurface (OMACVM_SCANOUT_IOSURFACE=1), a frame
+ * the guest flipped to goes on the layer as that buffer: no draw. virgl holds the
+ * guest's next write into a buffer while anything still uses it (vrend_scanout_write_hold).
